summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I cannot possibly overstate how frustrating this experience has been.\n\nWe started with a working python app, requiring only small edits and improvements.\n\no1-preview kinda worked for a BIT but kept saying \"code provided in the last reply\" instead of replying with the new, improved code it SAID it was generating.\n\nthen I run out of credits, so I switch to 4o...\n\nGPT 4o spent the entire day destroying all of my code until it had separately broken every single function.\n\nSo I hit up support, who don't give me any love despite my being a Plus subscriber AND a Copilot subscriber.\n\nThey were so dismissive they even suggested that I use ONLY GPT 4o and use it in Canvas! That's some TERRIBLE support for Copilot, is it not? When your support tells the end users to use another product that's a total failure in my opinion. It's essentially blaming the customer for using your service. Baffling!\n\nAnyway, undeterred: I tried again and (surprise) the exact same thing happened again.\n\nI want my two days back.\n\nI want my money back.\n\nI wish I had nothing instead of GPT because at least with nothing: I'd know what I was getting.\n\nIt cannot be overstated just how false any claims OpenAI makes about GPT are. What a silly, silly company.\n\nI'm done.\n","closed_by":{"login":"dmitrivMS","id":9581278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1ODEyNzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9581278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS","html_url":"https://github.com/dmitrivMS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dmitrivMS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription